show/13605145\" title=\"Tatoeba · LeviHighway\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · LeviHighway\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">生命</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">せいめい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">生命；存在；（一生的）工作经历；职业生涯；生命力；精髓；灵魂；本质</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"142688\"><ruby>生命<rp>(</rp><rt>せいめい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はいつ<ruby>誕生<rp>(</rp><rt>たんじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>したのですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">生命什么时候出生?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">整理</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">せいり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">整理；排列；组织；整顿；调整；规范；清算；结算；合并；清理；偿还；裁员；削减；缩减；处置</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"84185\"><ruby>部屋<rp>(</rp><rt>へや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>整理<rp>(</rp><rt>せいり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をしたほうがいいよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">最好安排房间。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">咳</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">せき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">咳嗽；咳</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"82805\"><ruby>母親<rp>(</rp><rt>ははおや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はトムの<ruby>咳<rp>(</rp><rt>せき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のことを<ruby>心配<rp>(</rp><rt>しんぱい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>している。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">妈妈担心汤姆的咳嗽。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">石炭</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">せきたん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">煤炭</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"142330\"><ruby>石炭<rp>(</rp><rt>せきたん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>石油<rp>(</rp><rt>せきゆ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>代<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わりに<ruby>使<rp>(</rp><rt>つか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我用煤炭代替石油。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">責任</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">せきにん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">职责；责任（含对下属的监督责任）；责任；义务</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"225211\">けんかは<ruby>両方<rp>(</rp><rt>りょうほう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>責任<rp>(</rp><rt>せきにん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">争吵是两者的责任。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">石油</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">せきゆ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">石油；原油；（口语）煤油；火油</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"96717\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らは<ruby>石油<rp>(</rp><rt>せきゆ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>船<rp>(</rp><rt>ふね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>積<rp>(</rp><rt>つ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>み<ruby>込<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んでいる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他们把石油放在船上。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">世間</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">せけん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">世间；社会；世人；公众</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"103406\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>世間<rp>(</rp><rt>せけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でいう<ruby>音楽<rp>(</rp><rt>おんがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>真<rp>(</rp><rt>しん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>愛好者<rp>(</rp><rt>あいこうしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他是全世界音乐的真正爱好者。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">積極的</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">せっきょくてき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">积极的；主动的；进取的；能动的；有为的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"118488\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>父<rp>(</rp><rt>ちち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>持<rp>(</rp><rt>も</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っている<ruby>積極的<rp>(</rp><rt>せっきょくてき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>全然<rp>(</rp><rt>ぜんぜん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他的父亲对他没有任何积极性。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">設計</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">せっけい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">计划；设计；布局</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"120891\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がその<ruby>新<rp>(</rp><rt>あたら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しいビルを<ruby>設計<rp>(</rp><rt>せっけい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他设计了新建筑。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/6148212\" title=\"Tatoeba · verdastelo9604\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · verdastelo9604\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">セット</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">一套；组合；设置；准备；安排；摆放；配置；设定（闹钟等）；（头发的）定型；做发型；（网球）一盘；（排球等）一局；（戏剧、电影等的）布景；片场；（电视或收音机）接收机</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"79909\"><ruby>目覚<rp>(</rp><rt>めざ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ましを７<ruby>時<rp>(</rp><rt>じ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にセットしよう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">让我们在7点起床。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">説</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">せつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">学说；主义；理论；观点；看法；主张；传言；谣言；风闻</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"160838\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はこの<ruby>説<rp>(</rp><rt>せつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>信<rp>(</rp><rt>しん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じることは<ruby>出来<rp>(</rp><rt>でき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我不能相信这个理论。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">設備</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">せつび</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">设备；设施；装置；配套设施；便利设施</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"209631\">その<ruby>実験室<rp>(</rp><rt>じっけんしつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>最新式<rp>(</rp><rt>さいしんしき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>設備<rp>(</rp><rt>せつび</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">实验室设有最新的装备。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">節約</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">せつやく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">节约；节省</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"148686\"><ruby>主婦<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>節約<rp>(</rp><rt>せつやく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>努<rp>(</rp><rt>つと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めるべきである。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">家庭主妇应该努力节省。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">責める</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">せめる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">谴责；指责；批评；非难；控告；督促；催促；纠缠；折磨；拷问；迫害；调教；驯服（马匹）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"101123\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はうそをついたと<ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>責<rp>(</rp><rt>せ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他指责她说谎。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">専攻</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">せんこう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a cl