=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她昨天买了一间新房子。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">選択</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">せんたく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">选择；挑选；选项</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"144025\"><ruby>人生<rp>(</rp><rt>じんせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>における<ruby>難<rp>(</rp><rt>むずか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しさは<ruby>選択<rp>(</rp><rt>せんたく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>である。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">生活中的困难就是选择。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">センター</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">中心；中央；中外野手</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"184324\"><ruby>学生<rp>(</rp><rt>がくせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>センターは<ruby>話<rp>(</rp><rt>はなし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をするのに<ruby>良<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いところだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">学生中心是谈话的好地方。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">税</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぜい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">税；赋税</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"203442\">タバコにかけられている<ruby>税<rp>(</rp><rt>ぜい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>高<rp>(</rp><rt>たか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">吸烟的税率很高。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-h